config files): none.\r\n- Python version used: 3.9.1\r\n- Operating system and version: MacOS\r\n\r\nIt was all good in v0.790.\r\n\r\nThe master branch is also broken (as of 2021-02-10, 6bfc2dbc0e877408f5b70b86818683cd211c0031).\r\n\r\nThe error appears after the commit 45d3655c38a7260bd91a0324b4048a585f152016 as identified by git bisection:\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ cat ./test1.sh\r\n#!/bin/bash\r\nset -x\r\ngit submodule update mypy/typeshed\r\npip install -e .\r\nmypy --strict --ignore-missing-imports test1.py || exit 1\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ chmod a+x test1.sh\r\n$ git bisect start v0.800 v0.790 --\r\n$ git bisect run ./test1.sh\r\n………\r\n45d3655c38a7260bd91a0324b4048a585f152016 is the first bad commit\r\n```\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/10063/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/10063/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]